1. registerRunner: after insertRunner, if chipCode != null → insertRunnerChip(raceId, bib, chipCode, now, null, now) + insertChipActive(chipCode, raceId, bib, now); catch DuplicateKeyException → ConflictException("芯片已被绑定： " + chipCode). Note: the insertRunner DuplicateKey catch is around insertRunner only. Chip binding duplicate → also DuplicateKeyException from chip_active PK. Add try/catch around chip inserts.

