Also what about oldChip == newChip check placement — fine.

Edge: effectiveAt monotonic vs previous replacements: periodStart = openPeriod.effectiveFrom which equals previous replacement's effectiveAt. So effectiveAt < previous effectiveAt → 422. Covered.

