Now the service layer. First update RaceService interface, then RaceServiceImpl. Also ResponseMapper for chipCode in CheckpointPassResponse and snapshot runner timing.

RaceService interface additions:

```java
    /** 选手退赛：释放生效芯片，之后禁止提交分段与更换芯片。 */
    ServiceResult withdrawRunner(String raceId, String bib, WithdrawRunnerRequest request);

    /** 芯片更换：登记旧新芯片、UTC生效时刻与裁判确认，重算该选手分段归属。 */
    ServiceResult replaceChip(String raceId, String bib, ReplaceChipRequest request);

    /** 查询选手芯片更换历史（只读，按生效时刻稳定排序）。 */
    ChipReplacementHistoryResponse getChipReplacements(String raceId, String bib);

