    ChipReplacementDetailResponse getChipReplacement(String raceId, String replacementId);
```

RaceServiceImpl changes:
1. registerRunner: after insertRunner, if chipCode != null → insertRunnerChip(raceId, bib, chipCode, now, null, now) + insertChipActive(chipCode, raceId, bib, now); catch DuplicateKeyException → ConflictException("芯片已被绑定： " + chipCode). Note: the insertRunner DuplicateKey catch is around insertRunner only. Chip binding duplicate → also DuplicateKeyException from chip_active PK. Add try/catch around chip inserts.

2. submitTiming: after requireRunner, check runner.withdrawn() → ConflictException("选手已退赛，禁止提交分段： " + bib). Stamp chip: findChipPeriodAt(raceId, bib, now).map(RunnerChipRow::chipCode).orElse(null) — now = clock.millis(). Set on row.

3. addPenalty: after insertPenalty, if type == DISQUALIFY → releaseChip(raceId, bib, now): closeOpenChipPeriod + deleteChipActive if open period existed.

4. withdrawRunner:
```java
    @Override
    @Transactional
    public ServiceResult withdrawRunner(String raceId, String bib, WithdrawRunnerRequest request) {
        return withIdempotency(request.requestId(), "WITHDRAW_RUNNER",
                orderedParams(
                        "raceId", raceId,
                        "bib", bib,
                        "operator", request.operator(),
                        "expectedVersion", request.expectedVersion()),
                () -> {
                    RaceRow race = requireOpenRace(raceId, request.expectedVersion());
                    RunnerRow runner = requireRunner(raceId, bib);
                    if (runner.withdrawn()) {
                        throw new ConflictException("选手已退赛: " + bib);
                    }
                    long now = clock.millis();
                    bumpVersion(race, request.expectedVersion());
                    int updated = repository.markRunnerWithdrawn(raceId, bib, now);
                    if (updated == 0) {
                        throw new ConflictException("选手已退赛: " + bib);
                    }
                    releaseActiveChip(raceId, bib, now);
                    return ServiceResult.ok(new WithdrawalResponse(bib, now, race.version() + 1));
                });
    }
```

5. replaceChip:
```java
    @Override
    @Transactional
    public ServiceResult replaceChip(String raceId, String bib, ReplaceChipRequest request) {
        return withIdempotency(request.requestId(), "REPLACE_CHIP",
                orderedParams(
                        "raceId", raceId,
                        "bib", bib,
                        "replacementId", request.replacementId(),
                        "oldChipCode", request.oldChipCode(),
                        "newChipCode", request.newChipCode(),
                        "effectiveAt", request.effectiveAt(),
                        "referee", request.referee(),
                        "operator", request.operator(),
                        "expectedVersion", request.expectedVersion()),
                () -> {
                    ChipReplacementRow existing = repository.findChipReplacement(request.replacementId()).orElse(null);
                    if (existing != null) {
                        return replayReplacementOrConflict(raceId, bib, request, existing);
                    }
                    RaceRow race = requireOpenRace(raceId, request.expectedVersion());
                    RunnerRow runner = requireRunner(raceId, bib);
                    if (runner.withdrawn()) {
                        throw new ConflictException("选手已退赛，禁止更换芯片: " + bib);
                    }
                    requireNotDisqualified(raceId, bib);
                    long effectiveAt = request.effectiveAt();
                    String oldChip = request.oldChipCode();
                    String newChip = request.newChipCode();
                    if (oldChip.equals(newChip)) {
                        throw new UnprocessableEntityException("新旧芯片代码必须不同: " + newChip);
                    }
                    Optional<RunnerChipRow> openPeriod = repository.findOpenChipPeriod(raceId, bib);
                    if (openPeriod.isPresent() && !openPeriod.get().chipCode().equals(oldChip)) {
                        throw new UnprocessableEntityException("旧芯片与当前生效芯片不一致: 实际="
                                + openPeriod.get().chipCode() + ", 要求=" + oldChip);
                    }
                    long periodStart = openPeriod.map(RunnerChipRow::effectiveFrom).orElse(runner.createdAt());
                    if (effectiveAt < periodStart) {
                        throw new UnprocessableEntityException("替换生效时刻早于当前芯片生效时刻: 实际="
                                + effectiveAt + ", 要求>=" + periodStart);
                    }
                    // 新芯片不得已被其他未完赛选手绑定；旧芯片首次登记时也不得占用他人芯片
                    ensureChipNotBound(newChip, "新芯片已绑定");
                    if (openPeriod.isEmpty()) {
                        ensureChipNotBound(oldChip, "旧芯片已被其他选手绑定");
                    }
                    List<CheckpointTimingRow> timings = repository.findTimingsForRunner(raceId, bib);
                    long latestReading = timings.stream().mapToLong(CheckpointTimingRow::createdAt).max().orElse(Long.MIN_VALUE);
                    if (effectiveAt < latestReading) {
                        throw new UnprocessableEntityException("替换生效时刻早于已接收分段读数: 实际="
                                + effectiveAt + ", 要求>=" + latestReading
                                + ", 差额=" + (latestReading - effectiveAt) + "毫秒");
                    }
                    // 重算归属：生效前归旧芯片，生效时刻起归新芯片（左闭右开）；任一读数无法唯一归属则整次回滚
                    List<ChipReplacementDetailRow> details = new ArrayList<>();
                    int reassigned = 0;
                    for (CheckpointTimingRow timing : timings) {
                        String expected = ChipAttribution.chipFor(timing.createdAt(), effectiveAt, oldChip, newChip);
                        String violation = ChipAttribution.uniquenessViolation(timing.chipCode(), expected);
                        if (violation != null) {
                            throw new UnprocessableEntityException(violation + ": timingId=" + timing.timingId());
                        }
                        if (!expected.equals(timing.chipCode())) {
                            reassigned++;
                            details.add(new ChipReplacementDetailRow(
                                    request.replacementId(), timing.timingId(), timing.checkpointCode(),
                                    timing.position(), timing.chipCode(), expected));
                        }
                    }
                    long now = clock.millis();
                    bumpVersion(race, request.expectedVersion());
                    // 整批核对完成后一次性落库：关闭旧区间、开启新区间、改写读数归属、固化更换档案
                    if (openPeriod.isPresent()) {
                        repository.closeOpenChipPeriod(raceId, bib, effectiveAt);
                        repository.deleteChipActive(oldChip);
                    } else {
                        repository.insertRunnerChip(raceId, bib, oldChip, runner.createdAt(), effectiveAt, now);
                    }
                    repository.insertRunnerChip(raceId, bib, newChip, effectiveAt, null, now);
                    try {
                        repository.insertChipActive(newChip, raceId, bib, effectiveAt);
                    } catch (DuplicateKeyException ex) {
                        throw new ConflictException("新芯片已绑定: " + newChip);
                    }
                    for (ChipReplacementDetailRow detail : details) {
                        repository.updateTimingChip(detail.timingId(), detail.chipAfter());
                    }
                    ChipReplacementRow record = new ChipReplacementRow(
                            request.replacementId(), raceId, bib, oldChip, newChip, effectiveAt,
                            request.referee(), request.operator(), reassigned, now);
                    try {
                        repository.insertChipReplacement(record);
                    } catch (DuplicateKeyException ex) {
                        ChipReplacementRow concurrent = repository.findChipReplacement(request.replacementId()).orElseThrow();
                        return replayReplacementOrConflict(raceId, bib, request, concurrent);
                    }
                    repository.insertChipReplacementDetails(details);
                    return ServiceResult.created(toReplacementResponse(record, race.version() + 1));
                });
    }
```

Wait — the "无法唯一归属" check: uniquenessViolation(currentChip, expected) returns violation when currentChip != null && !currentChip.equals(expected). But if currentChip is some foreign chip, violation → 422 rollback. Good. But note: if currentChip equals expected, no detail row (no change). If currentChip null → detail with chipBefore null. Good.

Hmm, one issue: the check `ensureChipNotBound(oldChip, ...)` when openPeriod is empty — the old chip being declared for the first time. If oldChip is actively bound to another runner → 409. But what if oldChip is bound to THIS runner? Can't be — openPeriod empty means no active binding for this runner, and chip_active is maintained in sync. OK.

Also what about oldChip == newChip check placement — fine.

Edge: effectiveAt monotonic vs previous replacements: periodStart = openPeriod.effectiveFrom which equals previous replacement's effectiveAt. So effectiveAt < previous effectiveAt → 422. Covered.

replayReplacementOrConflict:
```java
    private ServiceResult replayReplacementOrConflict(
            String raceId, String bib, ReplaceChipRequest request, ChipReplacementRow existing) {
        boolean sameParams = existing.raceId().equals(raceId)
                && existing.bib().equals(bib)
                && existing.oldChipCode().equals(request.oldChipCode())
                && existing.newChipCode().equals(request.newChipCode())
                && existing.effectiveAt() == request.effectiveAt()
                && existing.referee().equals(request.referee())
                && existing.operator().equals(request.operator());
        if (!sameParams) {
            throw new ConflictException("replacementId 已用于不同参数的芯片更换: " + request.replacementId());
        }
        // 重放首次成功响应：版本号无法从历史记录还原，使用当前赛事版本
        ...
    }
```

Hmm — replay needs the version at first success. ChipReplacementRow doesn't store version. The response includes version. For exact replay, I should store the response... The withIdempotency already handles requestId-level replay with stored body. The replacementId second-level replay (different requestId, same replacementId) — for timingId replay, the response is built from the stored timing row (createdAt etc. all in row). For replacement, response includes `version` which isn't in the row. Options: add version column to chip_replacement? The schema I wrote doesn't have it. I could recompute... no. Add `race_version` column to chip_replacement — it's part of the固化 record anyway ("更换记录固化芯片、时刻、裁判与重算前后归属" — version not required but useful). Let me add race_version INT to chip_replacement table and row. That makes replay exact. I'll update schema + row + insert + mapper.

Actually simpler: response version = race.version() + 1 at creation; store it. Yes, add column.

